      "content": "That feels a bit one-sided. You're basically saying that traditional values are inherently problematic, which is a pretty heavy claim. If someone believes that maintaining cultural continuity and individual accountability are the foundations of a stable community, are they just automatically \"wrong\" or regressive according to your framework?",
